WEBVTT

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:36.860 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.910 line:0%
[Episode 37]

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.440 line:0%
You can't provide me with

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.120 line:0%
a peaceful and carefree home,

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:47.490 line:0%
nor do you understand how to put your husband first.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:49.140 line:0%
You're so competitive,

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.770 line:0%
always trying to stand out.

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:53.559 line:0%
You're not the right person

00:01:53.559 --> 00:01:55.360 line:0%
to spend the rest of my life with.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:13.560 line:0%
What did you say?

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.700 line:0%
Is that really how you think of me?

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:36.720 line:0%
Do you really think

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.240 line:0%
you're a good wife?

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.040 line:0%
Your mind is always on the cases,

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.620 line:0%
and your eyes are always on the files.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.600 line:0%
Have you ever seriously

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:51.879 line:0%
thought about

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.240 line:0%
what kind of wife a man wants?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.330 line:0%
You were a substitute bride to begin with,

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.210 line:0%
carrying the identity of a spy.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.010 line:0%
Don't forget the three delusions.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.550 line:0%
The three-month period has passed.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.280 line:0%
I, Shen Du,

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.410 line:0%
am determined to divorce you.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:56.850 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.280 line:0%
then let's divorce.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.280 line:0%
From today on, I, Yan Xing,

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.880 line:0%
and you, Shen Du, will go

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:14.940 line:0%
our separate ways.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.680 line:0%
Everything related to White Ghost

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.610 line:0%
have nothing to do with me anymore.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.460 line:0%
The honor and disgrace of your Shen family

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.120 line:0%
will no longer concern me!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.600 line:0%
♫My heart burned, leaving me cold and forlorn♫

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:35.450 line:0%
♫And a lifetime of loneliness♫

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.959 line:0%
♫My love blazed. Where did it scatter♫

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.200 line:0%
♫And where did it leave its marks?♫

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.850 line:0%
♫Drifting through the mist♫

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:50.540 line:0%
♫Amidst the vast, endless waves, I searched in the darkness♫

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:55.640 line:0%
♫You passed by, igniting fireworks♫

00:04:58.209 --> 00:05:03.360 line:0%
♫For the sake of an end, I embraced silence and became a Shura♫

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:10.150 line:0%
♫Love is elusive, piercing you and burning me♫

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:16.170 line:0%
♫Along the way, flowers bloom and fall, rain pours heavily♫

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:19.020 line:0%
♫Lights will cross♫

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.900 line:0%
♫You are my destination♫

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.380 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my loneliness and confusion?♫

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.170 line:0%
♫Understanding my fragility, no words are needed♫

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.490 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my panic and obsession?♫

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:39.100 line:0%
♫Sheltering my solitude, never letting me fall♫

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:43.020 line:0%
♫The chains of fate between us cannot be broken♫

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.940 line:0%
♫Holding the warmth you once gave♫

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:52.860 line:0%
♫Guiding me to see myself, the person I truly am♫

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:56.930 line:0%
♫Who will save me from right and wrong?♫

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.240 line:0%
♫Tossed in the sea of people, just hold me tight♫

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.050 line:0%
♫Who will save me from grudges and karma?♫

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.350 line:0%
♫Healing my sorrow, never letting me escape♫

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.450 line:0%
♫The past fades, how many times have we met?♫

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.400 line:0%
♫Who can break free from destiny?♫

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:22.770 line:0%
♫I'll cross rivers and leap into fire for you♫

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:30.390 line:0%
♫I'm willing to disappear with you in the hustle and bustle♫

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:43.520 line:0%
Xing.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:45.959 line:0%
Xing.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:49.200 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.360 line:0%
You look so pale.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.440 line:0%
What happened?

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.200 line:0%
Mother.

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:00.640 line:0%
Xing.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.310 line:0%
Xing.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:05.880 line:0%
Xing. Xing.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:19.400 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.790 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:50.800 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:05.650 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.280 line:0%
Xing.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.120 line:0%
You're awake.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.320 line:0%
Your high fever

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.830 line:0%
really scared me.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.640 line:0%
Where are you going?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.120 line:0%
I'm going to find Shen Du.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.400 line:0%
You mustn't!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.440 line:0%
Why are you still looking for that jerk?

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.350 line:0%
You braved the snow to plead his innocence,

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:47.400 line:0%
but what about him?

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.800 line:0%
He's just been released.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.480 line:0%
He didn't care about your illness,

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:51.160 line:0%
and...

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.320 line:0%
And what?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.540 line:0%
What's wrong with your voice?

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:57.550 line:0%
And what?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.730 line:0%
And he brought a divorce paper.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:22.900 line:0%
Mother,

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.410 line:0%
where's the divorce paper?

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.600 line:0%
Where's the divorce paper, Mother?

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:34.060 line:0%
Where's the divorce paper?

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:37.280 line:0%
Where's the divorce paper, Mother?

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:42.300 line:0%
Where's the divorce paper?

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:46.960 line:0%
Where's the divorce paper?

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.790 line:0%
Where's the divorce paper?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.760 line:0%
Mother.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.960 line:0%
I still can't believe it.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.760 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen usually seems

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.490 line:0%
so upright and incorruptible.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:17.800 line:0%
How could he

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.660 line:0%
openly side with the Black Rakshasa?

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.400 line:0%
Shen Du has led the Imperial Security Bureau

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.760 line:0%
and arrested many officials who haven't joined Lai Luozhi

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:25.760 line:0%
for the Imperial Investigation Department

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:26.960 line:0%
these past few days.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.160 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau has now

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:30.200 line:0%
completely degraded into

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:33.200 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department's watchdog.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.440 line:0%
Since he's made that choice,

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.360 line:0%
our Yan family...

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.080 line:0%
Mojie,

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.050 line:0%
since Shen Du

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.080 line:0%
has sent the divorce paper,

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.200 line:0%
no matter what he does

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.440 line:0%
in the future,

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.040 line:0%
it will have nothing to do

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.640 line:0%
with our Yan family anymore.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.160 line:0%
Given the current situation, divorce

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.080 line:0%
might not be a bad thing for the Yan family

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.880 line:0%
to stay away from the conflicts.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:57.780 line:0%
But I'm afraid Xing

00:10:58.480 --> 00:10:59.680 line:0%
will be heartbroken.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.550 line:0%
[Changmo Pavilion]

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:06.280 line:0%
There's even more

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.680 line:0%
making her heartbroken.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.560 line:0%
Those who have always been close to her,

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.760 line:0%
that Constable Marshal

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:12.000 line:0%
and Miss Yun Que,

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.730 line:0%
were killed by the Imperial Investigation Department

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:15.940 line:0%
on the night

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:18.020 line:0%
they helped her appeal in the palace.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:24.490 line:0%
Xing.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.990 line:0%
Xu and Yun Que...

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:29.900 line:0%
are dead?

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.240 line:0%
Xing.

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:40.920 line:0%
Your fever just broke.

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:42.740 line:0%
Are you trying to kill yourself?

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:55.650 line:0%
[Grave of Constable Marshal Xu Xiangren and Miss Yun Que]

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:54.720 line:0%
Xu.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.100 line:0%
Yun Que.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.640 line:0%
I'm the one who got you killed.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.840 line:0%
I'm so sorry.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.040 line:0%
Even without you,

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.720 line:0%
they would have died anyway.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:27.890 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.280 line:0%
Don't blame

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:32.740 line:0%
their deaths on yourself.

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:36.030 line:0%
You're not that important.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.400 line:0%
Xu Xiangren wanted to investigate

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.400 line:0%
evidence of Lord Lai's treason.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.790 line:0%
So he had to die.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:59.130 line:0%
You really have sided with Lai Luozhi?

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.320 line:0%
The night Xu and Yun Que died,

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.420 line:0%
you were released.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.360 line:0%
You really...

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.820 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.860 line:0%
what's wrong with you?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.480 line:0%
Have you forgotten your ambitions?

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.480 line:0%
Have you forgotten the Shen family's old case

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:29.840 line:0%
and those dozens of innocent people

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.280 line:0%
who died unjustly?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.850 line:0%
I came here today

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:49.060 line:0%
to advise you not to complicate things further.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.040 line:0%
Think about the Yan family.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.210 line:0%
Sign the divorce paper.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.560 line:0%
[Yan]

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:15.490 line:0%
[Divorce Agreement Yan Xing]

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.340 line:0%
With your blood,

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.140 line:0%
we're divorced.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.590 line:0%
For Xu and Yun Que,

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.280 line:0%
for all those who died unjustly,

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.280 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:34.240 line:0%
from now on, you and I

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:36.600 line:0%
are strangers.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:03.060 line:0%
[Grave of Constable Marshal Xu Xiangren and Miss Yun Que]

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:33.260 line:0%
[Grave of Constable Marshal Xu Xiangren and Miss Yun Que]

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:12.389 line:0%
Xing.

00:17:15.629 --> 00:17:16.440 line:0%
Xing.

00:17:18.149 --> 00:17:19.350 line:0%
What happened to you?

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:27.680 line:0%
We went to the Yan's Mansion.

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.160 line:0%
Ms. Jin said you weren't home.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:29.840 line:0%
Jiang Langxing and I

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:31.240 line:0%
hurried over to find you.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.980 line:0%
You've been to the cemetery?

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.170 line:0%
Xu and Yun Que

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.720 line:0%
died because of me.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:43.680 line:0%
Xing.

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:45.860 line:0%
Don't say that.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.260 line:0%
The reason Lai Luozhi hated Commander Xu

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.280 line:0%
is also because he saved me.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.280 line:0%
But I left.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.830 line:0%
Commander Xu and Yun Que,

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:01.290 line:0%
they passed away peacefully.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:02.960 line:0%
I think...

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.320 line:0%
they must be

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.720 line:0%
happy in heaven.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.440 line:0%
You're hurt?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.790 line:0%
Shen Du has made up his mind

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.650 line:0%
to join forces with Lai Luozhi.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.120 line:0%
White Ghost

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:31.180 line:0%
has really teamed up with Lai Luozhi?

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.360 line:0%
He is no longer

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:50.080 line:0%
the Shen Du I once knew.

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.510 line:0%
From now on,

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.500 line:0%
I will have nothing to do with him.

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:13.600 line:0%
Xing.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:16.670 line:0%
Xing.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:20.190 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.930 line:0%
If you're worried about Xing,

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.760 line:0%
why don't you go talk to her?

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:19.640 line:0%
I know my own daughter.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.400 line:0%
Xing has always been independent and strong-willed.

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:25.000 line:0%
When facing such a big issue,

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.380 line:0%
if we approach her rashly,

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:28.400 line:0%
she will definitely

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:30.040 line:0%
try to ease our concerns

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.320 line:0%
by forcing a smile

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:33.920 line:0%
and hiding her feelings.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:37.760 line:0%
Indeed,

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:41.040 line:0%
Xing never lets anyone worry about her.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:44.920 line:0%
Women,

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:47.840 line:0%
above all, should not suppress their grievances

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:49.200 line:0%
and sorrows.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:50.800 line:0%
It will make them sick.

00:21:56.360 --> 00:21:58.200 line:0%
Let her be alone for a while.

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:25.580 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:21.360 line:0%
You can sleep there

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.400 line:0%
tonight.

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:28.920 line:0%
If you want to stay,

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:30.720 line:0%
there's still half the space inside.

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:35.870 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:32.360 line:0%
You sleep on the inside.

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:42.170 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:47.470 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:55.460 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:58.320 line:0%
She became my wife

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:02.020 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:00.710 line:0%
as if it were predestined.

00:23:02.920 --> 00:23:06.750 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:04.400 line:0%
I want to tell her

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:06.760 line:0%
that in my heart,

00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:08.850 line:0%
she has always been the one,

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:12.430 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:11.100 line:0%
from the very beginning.

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:17.220 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:18.040 line:0%
You can't provide me with

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.720 line:0%
a peaceful and carefree home,

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.230 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:23.090 line:0%
nor do you understand how to put your husband first.

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:24.610 line:0%
You're so competitive,

00:23:23.320 --> 00:23:27.160 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:26.080 line:0%
always trying to stand out.

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:27.080 line:0%
You're not the right person

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:28.560 line:0%
to spend the rest of my life with.

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:32.960 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:31.690 line:0%
The three-month period has passed.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:33.280 line:0%
I, Shen Du,

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:37.170 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:35.760 line:0%
am determined to divorce you.

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:42.480 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:47.150 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:04.780 line:0%
Haven't she eaten yet?

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:06.240 line:0%
Not a bite,

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:07.360 line:0%
and no medicine either.

00:24:07.360 --> 00:24:08.880 line:0%
She won't bandage the wound on her hand.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.440 line:0%
She won't even open the door.

00:24:10.440 --> 00:24:11.800 line:0%
What should we do?

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:15.480 line:0%
I've just gotten divorced too.

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:16.840 line:0%
Lately, I've been eating well and sleeping soundly.

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:18.760 line:0%
Life is much more enjoyable than before.

00:24:18.760 --> 00:24:19.560 line:0%
How about

00:24:19.640 --> 00:24:21.080 line:0%
I go and try to persuade her?

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:22.080 line:0%
Good idea.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:22.960 line:0%
Father!

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:25.720 line:0%
Father, bad news.

00:24:25.720 --> 00:24:27.560 line:0%
I just went to buy dried fruits for Xing

00:24:27.560 --> 00:24:29.160 line:0%
and saw people from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:24:29.160 --> 00:24:30.800 line:0%
all around our mansion.

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:37.560 line:0%
Are you sure it's the Imperial Investigation Department?

00:24:37.560 --> 00:24:39.240 line:0%
I've been in the Imperial Security Bureau for so long.

00:24:39.240 --> 00:24:40.400 line:0%
I can recognize these

00:24:40.400 --> 00:24:42.400 line:0%
undercover agents and informants.

00:24:42.400 --> 00:24:43.530 line:0%
Our mansion is being

00:24:43.840 --> 00:24:46.770 line:0%
watched by the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:24:47.720 --> 00:24:48.780 line:0%
This is a disaster.

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:51.960 line:0%
A disaster.

00:24:52.760 --> 00:24:54.320 line:0%
In all my years as an official,

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:56.400 line:0%
I've never seen anything like this.

00:24:57.640 --> 00:25:00.000 line:0%
The court situation is unpredictable now.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:01.760 line:0%
Lai Luozhi has too much power.

00:25:02.640 --> 00:25:04.800 line:0%
Shen Du just divorced Xing

00:25:04.800 --> 00:25:06.760 line:0%
and immediately joined Lai Luozhi.

00:25:06.760 --> 00:25:07.800 line:0%
What does this mean?

00:25:07.800 --> 00:25:08.800 line:0%
What does it mean?

00:25:10.160 --> 00:25:10.960 line:0%
It means

00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:14.360 line:0%
trouble for our Yan family.

00:25:14.850 --> 00:25:17.660 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:25:15.280 --> 00:25:16.560 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:25:16.730 --> 00:25:18.080 line:0%
with the beginning of spring approaching,

00:25:18.080 --> 00:25:20.000 line:0%
the annual Grand Court Assembly

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:21.920 line:0%
is about to start preparations.

00:25:21.920 --> 00:25:24.320 line:0%
This is the draft protocol

00:25:24.320 --> 00:25:25.760 line:0%
based on previous years' procedures,

00:25:25.760 --> 00:25:27.160 line:0%
prepared by the Ministry of Personnel and the Ministry of Rites.

00:25:27.160 --> 00:25:29.040 line:0%
At that time, officials from various regions

00:25:29.040 --> 00:25:30.880 line:0%
and military leaders from different garrisons

00:25:30.880 --> 00:25:33.320 line:0%
will return to Xiang'an to pay their respects and report on their duties.

00:25:33.320 --> 00:25:34.040 line:0%
However,

00:25:34.240 --> 00:25:36.120 line:0%
Since Your Majesty's ascension,

00:25:36.200 --> 00:25:37.560 line:0%
the Grand Court Assembly

00:25:37.560 --> 00:25:38.240 line:0%
has always been held

00:25:38.240 --> 00:25:40.680 line:0%
on the second day of the second lunar month, during spring plowing.

00:25:40.680 --> 00:25:41.640 line:0%
But this year,

00:25:41.680 --> 00:25:44.160 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager is in poor health.

00:25:44.280 --> 00:25:47.740 line:0%
Should the Grand Astrologer select another auspicious date?

00:25:52.800 --> 00:25:54.280 line:0%
The Grand Court Assembly

00:25:54.520 --> 00:25:55.200 line:0%
is a significant event

00:25:55.200 --> 00:25:57.600 line:0%
for determining state affairs

00:25:58.280 --> 00:25:59.920 line:0%
and involves officials and border generals

00:25:59.920 --> 00:26:01.840 line:0%
coming to the capital.

00:26:02.160 --> 00:26:04.000 line:0%
It should not be postponed lightly.

00:26:04.000 --> 00:26:06.000 line:0%
Let's stick to the original date.

00:26:06.560 --> 00:26:08.160 line:0%
If the Grand Empress Dowager

00:26:08.160 --> 00:26:09.880 line:0%
is still unwell by then,

00:26:10.040 --> 00:26:11.280 line:0%
I will accompany

00:26:11.720 --> 00:26:12.960 line:0%
His Majesty

00:26:12.960 --> 00:26:15.040 line:0%
to host the Grand Court Assembly.

00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:17.360 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:26:17.960 --> 00:26:19.220 line:0%
are you really going to

00:26:19.720 --> 00:26:21.480 line:0%
host the Grand Court Assembly

00:26:22.200 --> 00:26:24.400 line:0%
on behalf of the Grand Empress Dowager?

00:26:24.960 --> 00:26:26.240 line:0%
Why not?

00:26:26.640 --> 00:26:27.560 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:26:27.960 --> 00:26:29.360 line:0%
the Grand Court Assembly

00:26:29.440 --> 00:26:31.880 line:0%
is an annual grand event for all officials,

00:26:32.440 --> 00:26:34.440 line:0%
showcasing the imperial majesty

00:26:34.520 --> 00:26:35.800 line:0%
and royal dignity.

00:26:36.160 --> 00:26:38.220 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager's regency

00:26:38.320 --> 00:26:41.050 line:0%
is to perform the duties on behalf of His Majesty.

00:26:41.640 --> 00:26:42.440 line:0%
You?

00:26:43.320 --> 00:26:44.320 line:0%
By what right?

00:26:45.120 --> 00:26:47.400 line:0%
By the Grand Empress Dowager's trust in me.

00:26:47.400 --> 00:26:48.720 line:0%
By her entrusting me with the duty of

00:26:48.720 --> 00:26:50.250 line:0%
overseeing all officials.

00:26:50.720 --> 00:26:52.400 line:0%
I must shoulder

00:26:53.120 --> 00:26:55.600 line:0%
the responsibility for many court affairs.

00:26:58.880 --> 00:26:59.680 line:0%
I believe

00:27:01.120 --> 00:27:02.980 line:0%
His Majesty would also be willing

00:27:03.480 --> 00:27:04.200 line:0%
for me to accompany him

00:27:04.200 --> 00:27:06.200 line:0%
in hosting the Grand Court Assembly

00:27:06.650 --> 00:27:09.210 line:0%
and meeting officials and generals.

00:27:18.520 --> 00:27:19.440 line:0%
His Majesty is

00:27:19.440 --> 00:27:21.080 line:0%
inviting Lord Lai.

00:27:21.280 --> 00:27:22.760 line:0%
During the Grand Court Assembly,

00:27:22.760 --> 00:27:24.920 line:0%
His Majesty clearly wants Lord Lai

00:27:24.920 --> 00:27:26.600 line:0%
by his side.

00:27:27.400 --> 00:27:28.200 line:0%
Indeed.

00:27:28.320 --> 00:27:30.520 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has authorized Lord Lai

00:27:30.520 --> 00:27:31.980 line:0%
to oversee all officials.

00:27:32.240 --> 00:27:34.080 line:0%
It's legitimate for him

00:27:34.280 --> 00:27:36.140 line:0%
to host the Grand Court Assembly.

00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:38.800 line:0%
It's legitimate for Lord Lai

00:27:38.920 --> 00:27:41.160 line:0%
to host the Grand Court Assembly.

00:27:41.160 --> 00:27:42.600 line:0%
You bunch of rats!

00:27:42.840 --> 00:27:45.080 line:0%
You're shameless, distorting the truth!

00:27:45.080 --> 00:27:45.960 line:0%
And you,

00:27:46.200 --> 00:27:47.200 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:27:47.520 --> 00:27:49.560 line:0%
you're overstepping your bounds!

00:27:49.600 --> 00:27:51.440 line:0%
Your intention to usurp power is obvious!

00:27:51.440 --> 00:27:52.640 line:0%
You must be punished!

00:27:54.480 --> 00:27:55.740 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:27:55.880 --> 00:27:57.540 line:0%
you haven't said a word today.

00:27:57.600 --> 00:27:58.880 line:0%
Why don't you say something?

00:27:58.880 --> 00:28:02.280 line:0%
Insulting a high-ranking official without reason in court,

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:05.320 line:0%
according to the laws of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:28:05.320 --> 00:28:07.150 line:0%
is there a provision for this?

00:28:07.560 --> 00:28:09.640 line:0%
Anyone insulting high officials in court

00:28:09.640 --> 00:28:11.600 line:0%
should be imprisoned in the Imperial Security Bureau's dungeon

00:28:11.600 --> 00:28:13.330 line:0%
and punished by water torture.

00:28:14.800 --> 00:28:15.600 line:0%
Alright,

00:28:16.480 --> 00:28:17.640 line:0%
let it be so.

00:28:18.280 --> 00:28:19.240 line:0%
Shen Du, you...

00:28:20.160 --> 00:28:21.420 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:28:21.520 --> 00:28:22.520 line:0%
when did you

00:28:23.520 --> 00:28:25.120 line:0%
become a follower of Lai?

00:28:25.120 --> 00:28:26.050 line:0%
Minister Zhang.

00:28:27.770 --> 00:28:28.630 line:0%
Princess Ying.

00:28:28.840 --> 00:28:29.520 line:0%
You seem to be

00:28:29.520 --> 00:28:31.160 line:0%
quite dissatisfied with me.

00:28:31.480 --> 00:28:33.040 line:0%
Are you afraid

00:28:33.480 --> 00:28:34.520 line:0%
I'll expose your

00:28:34.520 --> 00:28:36.320 line:0%
dirty secrets?

00:28:37.040 --> 00:28:38.000 line:0%
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:38.800 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:28:39.560 --> 00:28:40.620 line:0%
and Minister Zhang

00:28:41.080 --> 00:28:43.280 line:0%
are colluding with rebels in Gannan Area,

00:28:43.280 --> 00:28:44.480 line:0%
plotting treachery!

00:28:44.800 --> 00:28:45.720 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:28:46.400 --> 00:28:47.920 line:0%
don't you dare slander me.

00:28:48.760 --> 00:28:49.680 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:28:50.800 --> 00:28:52.000 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:28:52.760 --> 00:28:53.680 line:0%
you've always

00:28:53.680 --> 00:28:55.800 line:0%
oppressed officials who oppose you.

00:28:56.040 --> 00:28:56.840 line:0%
Now

00:28:57.600 --> 00:28:59.760 line:0%
it's finally my turn.

00:29:00.320 --> 00:29:02.160 line:0%
But everything needs evidence.

00:29:02.320 --> 00:29:03.680 line:0%
In broad daylight,

00:29:03.700 --> 00:29:04.720 line:0%
you're not allowed

00:29:04.720 --> 00:29:05.880 line:0%
to distort the truth!

00:29:05.880 --> 00:29:06.520 line:0%
Evidence?

00:29:06.520 --> 00:29:08.120 line:0%
Of course there's evidence.

00:29:08.520 --> 00:29:10.240 line:0%
I obtained from the Imperial Security Bureau

00:29:10.240 --> 00:29:12.360 line:0%
the records previously submitted by

00:29:12.360 --> 00:29:13.880 line:0%
the criminal official Mo Qianzhi.

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:16.440 line:0%
Every detail is clearly recorded,

00:29:16.440 --> 00:29:18.160 line:0%
leaving no room for your arguments.

00:29:18.160 --> 00:29:18.600 line:0%
You--

00:29:20.170 --> 00:29:22.430 line:0%
Isn't that right, Grand Commander Shen?

00:29:23.680 --> 00:29:26.270 line:0%
According to Mo Qianzhi's previous confession,

00:29:26.270 --> 00:29:28.480 line:0%
Princess Ying colluded with the Gannan garrison.

00:29:28.480 --> 00:29:30.170 line:0%
Minister Zhang allowed his subordinates

00:29:30.170 --> 00:29:31.900 line:0%
to embezzle funds from Gannan.

00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:34.060 line:0%
They should be confined to their residences

00:29:34.060 --> 00:29:35.720 line:0%
for thorough investigation.

00:29:36.620 --> 00:29:38.020 line:0%
I won't

00:29:38.500 --> 00:29:40.180 line:0%
tolerate such recklessness!

00:29:41.080 --> 00:29:42.740 line:0%
Where are the Qianniu Guards?

00:29:53.710 --> 00:29:55.370 line:0%
Where are the Qianniu Guards?

00:29:57.200 --> 00:29:58.720 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:30:01.040 --> 00:30:03.280 line:0%
can't you see it now?

00:30:05.120 --> 00:30:07.440 line:0%
Most of the court already

00:30:08.280 --> 00:30:10.640 line:0%
belongs to the Lai faction now!

00:30:17.480 --> 00:30:19.160 line:0%
With your positions,

00:30:19.840 --> 00:30:21.160 line:0%
it's better for you

00:30:21.160 --> 00:30:23.120 line:0%
to leave gracefully.

00:30:23.400 --> 00:30:24.900 line:0%
Do I need to send

00:30:25.040 --> 00:30:26.840 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department and the Imperial Security Bureau

00:30:26.840 --> 00:30:27.880 line:0%
to arrest you?

00:30:29.650 --> 00:30:31.220 line:0%
Shen Du, you traitor!

00:30:31.440 --> 00:30:34.080 line:0%
You're in cahoots with the Black Rakshasa!

00:30:34.120 --> 00:30:35.080 line:0%
You

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:36.400 line:0%
lawless

00:30:36.400 --> 00:30:37.520 line:0%
traitorous rebels

00:30:37.680 --> 00:30:38.880 line:0%
will die in pain!

00:30:39.040 --> 00:30:41.000 line:0%
Die in pain!

00:30:49.140 --> 00:30:50.300 line:0%
Unexpectedly,

00:30:50.920 --> 00:30:53.290 line:0%
I've always been devoted,

00:30:53.520 --> 00:30:54.360 line:0%
yet still unable to repay

00:30:54.360 --> 00:30:56.960 line:0%
the kindness of His Majesty and the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:30:56.960 --> 00:30:58.520 line:0%
But these ignorant fools

00:30:58.520 --> 00:30:59.850 line:0%
twist my intentions so.

00:31:00.320 --> 00:31:03.160 line:0%
Now, with such a heavy responsibility on my shoulders,

00:31:03.160 --> 00:31:05.680 line:0%
I can only do my utmost to serve loyally

00:31:05.770 --> 00:31:07.320 line:0%
until death.

00:31:07.610 --> 00:31:10.540 line:0%
Who cares about my reputation in life or after death?

00:31:11.280 --> 00:31:12.320 line:0%
Isn't that right,

00:31:12.880 --> 00:31:14.140 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen?

00:31:21.720 --> 00:31:22.760 line:0%
Well then,

00:31:24.320 --> 00:31:26.180 line:0%
prepare the Grand Court Assembly

00:31:26.800 --> 00:31:28.400 line:0%
as we discussed earlier.

00:31:43.560 --> 00:31:44.720 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:31:45.120 --> 00:31:46.360 line:0%
You lowly commoners

00:31:46.360 --> 00:31:48.120 line:0%
dare to come here?

00:31:48.640 --> 00:31:49.400 line:0%
You're disgracing

00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:51.000 line:0%
the Hongwen Academy.

00:31:51.080 --> 00:31:53.120 line:0%
We must thoroughly clean it.

00:31:53.480 --> 00:31:54.280 line:0%
I

00:31:54.410 --> 00:31:55.480 line:0%
entered the Hongwen Academy

00:31:55.480 --> 00:31:57.880 line:0%
fair and square through the entrance exam.

00:31:58.200 --> 00:32:00.160 line:0%
Knowledge knows no class distinctions.

00:32:00.160 --> 00:32:02.120 line:0%
Why do you bully commoners?

00:32:02.480 --> 00:32:03.200 line:0%
You're nothing but

00:32:03.200 --> 00:32:04.160 line:0%
a dog let in

00:32:04.160 --> 00:32:05.400 line:0%
through the door.

00:32:05.640 --> 00:32:06.720 line:0%
Do you really think

00:32:06.720 --> 00:32:08.920 line:0%
you can be on equal footing with us nobles?

00:32:08.920 --> 00:32:09.880 line:0%
Remember this,

00:32:10.040 --> 00:32:11.960 line:0%
even if a dog enters the house,

00:32:11.960 --> 00:32:13.840 line:0%
it's still just a dog.

00:32:18.040 --> 00:32:19.080 line:0%
Well, Lord Lai

00:32:19.080 --> 00:32:20.880 line:0%
doesn't have any noble background either.

00:32:20.880 --> 00:32:22.760 line:0%
Yet you nobles

00:32:22.760 --> 00:32:24.000 line:0%
are all happy

00:32:24.120 --> 00:32:24.960 line:0%
to flatter and serve him

00:32:24.960 --> 00:32:27.320 line:0%
like dogs, aren't you?

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:28.800 line:0%
How dare you!

00:32:29.600 --> 00:32:30.400 line:0%
Beat him up!

00:32:38.800 --> 00:32:39.400 line:0%
Stop!

00:32:47.120 --> 00:32:47.920 line:0%
Guard Jing,

00:32:48.320 --> 00:32:49.720 line:0%
these noble students

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:51.600 line:0%
are ganging up on the commoners.

00:32:51.840 --> 00:32:52.770 line:0%
Hongwen Academy

00:32:52.960 --> 00:32:55.120 line:0%
is the highest institution of learning in Cang State,

00:32:55.120 --> 00:32:57.640 line:0%
directly under the Emperor's Imperial College.

00:32:57.640 --> 00:32:59.680 line:0%
Instead of focusing on your studies,

00:32:59.680 --> 00:33:00.920 line:0%
you're making a ruckus and fighting here.

00:33:00.920 --> 00:33:01.960 line:0%
What a disgrace!

00:33:01.960 --> 00:33:02.760 line:0%
I...

00:33:03.410 --> 00:33:04.400 line:0%
It was them.

00:33:04.720 --> 00:33:05.520 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:05.600 --> 00:33:06.400 line:0%
It's him.

00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:07.960 line:0%
He's the one stirring up trouble.

00:33:07.960 --> 00:33:09.720 line:0%
He's been disrupting our studies.

00:33:09.720 --> 00:33:11.360 line:0%
Yes, yes, it's him.

00:33:11.360 --> 00:33:13.220 line:0%
He's the one stirring up trouble.

00:33:14.440 --> 00:33:15.280 line:0%
Guard Jing.

00:33:15.280 --> 00:33:16.040 line:0%
No, it's not.

00:33:16.040 --> 00:33:16.920 line:0%
It's them.

00:33:20.200 --> 00:33:21.360 line:0%
Since you're disrupting

00:33:21.360 --> 00:33:22.760 line:0%
so many students here,

00:33:23.280 --> 00:33:24.880 line:0%
you'll be sent to the Imperial Security Bureau's prison

00:33:24.880 --> 00:33:26.410 line:0%
to reflect on your actions.

00:33:30.440 --> 00:33:31.280 line:0%
How did

00:33:31.840 --> 00:33:34.360 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau become like this?

00:33:34.360 --> 00:33:36.490 line:0%
Are you truly siding with the traitor?

00:33:36.960 --> 00:33:38.280 line:0%
It was Grand Commander Shen

00:33:38.280 --> 00:33:40.040 line:0%
who escorted us here to take the exams.

00:33:40.040 --> 00:33:40.920 line:0%
He said the Hongwen Academy

00:33:40.920 --> 00:33:44.050 line:0%
would recruit talents regardless of their background.

00:33:44.160 --> 00:33:44.960 line:0%
Now,

00:33:45.680 --> 00:33:47.240 line:0%
are you telling me

00:33:47.600 --> 00:33:49.640 line:0%
that we, students from humble backgrounds,

00:33:49.640 --> 00:33:51.040 line:0%
who have studied so hard,

00:33:51.560 --> 00:33:53.760 line:0%
were wrong?

00:34:00.880 --> 00:34:02.040 line:0%
Being insensible

00:34:02.440 --> 00:34:04.000 line:0%
and having no sense of propriety—

00:34:04.000 --> 00:34:05.200 line:0%
that's what's wrong.

00:34:05.880 --> 00:34:06.680 line:0%
Take him away.

00:34:08.170 --> 00:34:09.760 line:0%
You dare to fight against us?

00:34:09.760 --> 00:34:10.600 line:0%
That's right.

00:34:10.600 --> 00:34:11.600 line:0%
Serves him right.

00:34:17.470 --> 00:34:19.650 line:0%
Move aside! Move aside!

00:34:20.240 --> 00:34:21.240 line:0%
Get out of the way!

00:34:28.800 --> 00:34:30.120 line:0%
People call us

00:34:30.120 --> 00:34:31.850 line:0%
the Black and White Rakshasas.

00:34:32.240 --> 00:34:34.390 line:0%
Now that we're riding

00:34:34.470 --> 00:34:36.450 line:0%
in this world together,

00:34:36.920 --> 00:34:39.200 line:0%
it's quite an interesting experience.

00:34:40.640 --> 00:34:42.100 line:0%
On such a spacious street,

00:34:42.400 --> 00:34:43.600 line:0%
can't you people from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:34:43.600 --> 00:34:44.990 line:0%
even walk properly?

00:34:45.200 --> 00:34:46.990 line:0%
Must you charge around recklessly,

00:34:46.990 --> 00:34:48.280 line:0%
bullying the common people?

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:49.160 line:0%
Letting random people

00:34:49.160 --> 00:34:50.950 line:0%
hinder His Lordship's inspection—

00:34:50.950 --> 00:34:52.640 line:0%
are you performing your duty?

00:34:57.190 --> 00:34:58.810 line:0%
Our duty as constables

00:34:59.730 --> 00:35:01.340 line:0%
is to protect the capital

00:35:01.970 --> 00:35:03.750 line:0%
and ensure the safety of the people,

00:35:03.750 --> 00:35:06.090 line:0%
not to be anyone's road-clearing servants.

00:35:06.090 --> 00:35:07.550 line:0%
They're truly an eyesore.

00:35:09.520 --> 00:35:10.780 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:35:11.080 --> 00:35:13.600 line:0%
the capital's security is the Imperial Security Bureau's responsibility.

00:35:13.600 --> 00:35:15.080 line:0%
These petty troublemakers

00:35:15.080 --> 00:35:16.380 line:0%
don't need

00:35:17.200 --> 00:35:19.320 line:0%
to be in the city, causing a nuisance.

00:35:20.000 --> 00:35:20.800 line:0%
Indeed.

00:35:21.860 --> 00:35:22.660 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:24.520 line:0%
how can you be so blind to right and wrong,

00:35:24.520 --> 00:35:25.960 line:0%
aiding and abetting tyranny?

00:35:25.960 --> 00:35:26.760 line:0%
How can you face

00:35:26.760 --> 00:35:28.160 line:0%
the deceased Commander Xu and Yun Que?

00:35:28.160 --> 00:35:29.560 line:0%
How can you face Yan Xing?

00:35:34.670 --> 00:35:36.850 line:0%
A mere constable

00:35:37.160 --> 00:35:39.540 line:0%
dares to challenge the Grand Commander?

00:35:39.650 --> 00:35:41.260 line:0%
It seems you haven't tasted

00:35:41.440 --> 00:35:44.180 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department's punishment yet.

00:35:44.180 --> 00:35:45.000 line:0%
Guards!

00:35:45.520 --> 00:35:46.320 line:0%
Wait.

00:35:48.880 --> 00:35:50.440 line:0%
Since he insulted me,

00:35:50.760 --> 00:35:51.640 line:0%
let me

00:35:51.840 --> 00:35:53.560 line:0%
handle it myself.

00:36:18.520 --> 00:36:20.120 line:0%
I'm sparing your life today,

00:36:20.160 --> 00:36:21.200 line:0%
so you can go back

00:36:21.200 --> 00:36:23.000 line:0%
and keep your brothers in check.

00:36:23.760 --> 00:36:25.000 line:0%
Tell your friends

00:36:25.400 --> 00:36:26.520 line:0%
that any past

00:36:27.160 --> 00:36:28.000 line:0%
favors are

00:36:28.000 --> 00:36:29.590 line:0%
all gone now.

00:36:29.760 --> 00:36:31.820 line:0%
If you dare to speak out of turn again,

00:36:32.040 --> 00:36:34.200 line:0%
I'll make sure you beg for life

00:36:34.200 --> 00:36:35.460 line:0%
and wish you were dead.

00:36:45.280 --> 00:36:46.450 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:36:46.570 --> 00:36:47.350 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:36:47.720 --> 00:36:49.640 line:0%
Jiang Langxing was humiliated

00:36:49.680 --> 00:36:51.520 line:0%
by White Ghost in public.

00:36:52.200 --> 00:36:53.210 line:0%
What?

00:36:53.080 --> 00:36:56.350 line:0%
[Just Rewards and Punishments]

00:36:53.730 --> 00:36:56.330 line:0%
Shen Du publicly humiliated Jiang Langxing?

00:36:56.680 --> 00:36:57.480 line:0%
Yes,

00:36:57.480 --> 00:36:59.200 line:0%
that's what I heard.

00:36:59.630 --> 00:37:01.800 line:0%
It's because he and the constables

00:37:01.800 --> 00:37:03.280 line:0%
offended Lord Lai.

00:37:04.650 --> 00:37:05.450 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:37:05.600 --> 00:37:06.400 line:0%
So,

00:37:06.480 --> 00:37:08.040 line:0%
he's joined Lai Luozhi?

00:37:10.280 --> 00:37:11.940 line:0%
The Black and White Rakshasas

00:37:12.560 --> 00:37:13.920 line:0%
have united, huh?

00:37:14.480 --> 00:37:15.480 line:0%
Shen Du...

00:37:16.040 --> 00:37:17.280 line:0%
I'd like to see

00:37:17.280 --> 00:37:19.120 line:0%
if he has any conscience left.

00:37:19.440 --> 00:37:21.340 line:0%
Where is the Director of the Ministry of Justice?

00:37:21.340 --> 00:37:24.190 line:0%
[Just Rewards and Punishments]

00:37:21.480 --> 00:37:22.280 line:0%
Let go of me.

00:37:22.400 --> 00:37:23.280 line:0%
Go quickly.

00:37:30.880 --> 00:37:31.880 line:0%
Behave yourself.

00:37:37.720 --> 00:37:39.160 line:0%
Lord Lai, what brings you to

00:37:39.160 --> 00:37:40.160 line:0%
the Ministry of Justice today?

00:37:40.160 --> 00:37:40.920 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:37:45.440 --> 00:37:46.240 line:0%
Nerd Jiang.

00:37:48.640 --> 00:37:49.480 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:37:50.520 --> 00:37:52.000 line:0%
I received a complaint

00:37:52.600 --> 00:37:54.240 line:0%
that the records in the Ministry of Justice are incomplete

00:37:54.240 --> 00:37:55.500 line:0%
and full of loopholes.

00:37:56.080 --> 00:37:58.000 line:0%
Who's responsible for this?

00:37:58.680 --> 00:37:59.720 line:0%
It's...

00:38:07.960 --> 00:38:09.560 line:0%
So it's Secretary Lu.

00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:11.280 line:0%
Well,

00:38:11.280 --> 00:38:13.120 line:0%
what a coincidence.

00:38:15.520 --> 00:38:16.560 line:0%
Who dared to complain about

00:38:16.560 --> 00:38:17.960 line:0%
the Ministry of Justice?

00:38:20.680 --> 00:38:22.600 line:0%
Don't they know that Secretary Lu

00:38:23.050 --> 00:38:24.610 line:0%
is my woman?

00:38:27.780 --> 00:38:28.540 line:0%
Drag him out!

00:38:28.570 --> 00:38:29.210 line:0%
Yes.

00:38:30.680 --> 00:38:31.360 line:0%
If anyone

00:38:31.360 --> 00:38:33.360 line:0%
dares to bother Secretary Lu again,

00:38:33.840 --> 00:38:36.000 line:0%
they will be going against me.

00:38:38.400 --> 00:38:39.200 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:38:40.760 --> 00:38:41.640 line:0%
rest assured.

00:38:42.680 --> 00:38:44.120 line:0%
No matter where you go,

00:38:45.240 --> 00:38:46.500 line:0%
you're still my woman.

00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:47.360 line:0%
No way!

00:38:49.700 --> 00:38:50.500 line:0%
Is that so?

00:39:09.300 --> 00:39:10.550 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:39:11.390 --> 00:39:12.320 line:0%
You thief!

00:39:12.680 --> 00:39:13.520 line:0%
Let me go!

00:39:13.920 --> 00:39:16.160 line:0%
If you have the guts, let's fight to the death!

00:39:16.160 --> 00:39:16.880 line:0%
You, who have been

00:39:16.880 --> 00:39:18.360 line:0%
crushed under my feet like an ant,

00:39:18.360 --> 00:39:20.040 line:0%
dare to negotiate with me?

00:39:20.200 --> 00:39:21.040 line:0%
Do you even deserve it?

00:39:21.040 --> 00:39:21.880 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:39:21.900 --> 00:39:23.300 line:0%
what exactly do you want?

00:39:25.880 --> 00:39:26.680 line:0%
What?

00:39:28.220 --> 00:39:29.480 line:0%
Feeling sorry for him?

00:39:32.970 --> 00:39:33.840 line:0%
You actually shed tears

00:39:33.840 --> 00:39:35.840 line:0%
for such an insignificant ant.

00:39:37.200 --> 00:39:38.720 line:0%
I feel bad for you.

00:39:42.160 --> 00:39:42.960 line:0%
Actually,

00:39:43.800 --> 00:39:46.640 line:0%
I really don't want to make things difficult for you.

00:39:46.640 --> 00:39:48.770 line:0%
However, I couldn't sleep last night

00:39:50.160 --> 00:39:51.440 line:0%
and thought of

00:39:52.090 --> 00:39:54.190 line:0%
that folk song you once sang.

00:39:58.260 --> 00:40:00.140 line:0%
Why don't you sing it for me again?

00:40:00.990 --> 00:40:03.080 line:0%
Maybe if I'm in a better mood,

00:40:03.440 --> 00:40:04.360 line:0%
I'll be willing

00:40:07.130 --> 00:40:08.530 line:0%
to show some mercy.

00:40:09.560 --> 00:40:10.360 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:40:10.920 --> 00:40:12.390 line:0%
don't listen to him.

00:40:12.440 --> 00:40:13.370 line:0%
Don't sing.

00:40:13.660 --> 00:40:14.730 line:0%
Shut up!

00:40:15.120 --> 00:40:15.920 line:0%
Don't sing.

00:40:24.040 --> 00:40:28.170 line:0%
♫Speak not in vain♫

00:40:31.120 --> 00:40:35.080 line:0%
♫The old lady scolds♫

00:40:38.190 --> 00:40:48.120 line:0%
♫Mother picks flowers endlessly♫

00:40:50.370 --> 00:40:53.600 line:0%
♫Speak not in vain♫

00:40:54.400 --> 00:40:55.640 line:0%
Be a good boy, Luozhi.

00:40:59.480 --> 00:41:01.150 line:0%
♫Speak not in vain♫

00:41:02.470 --> 00:41:04.170 line:0%
♫The old lady scolds♫

00:41:05.020 --> 00:41:08.570 line:0%
♫Mother picks flowers endlessly♫

00:41:08.830 --> 00:41:10.830 line:0%
♫The old lady scolds♫

00:41:11.000 --> 00:41:13.080 line:0%
♫The old lady scolds♫

00:41:25.760 --> 00:41:27.230 line:0%
I've said before,

00:41:28.000 --> 00:41:29.680 line:0%
as long as you don't leave me,

00:41:30.020 --> 00:41:31.710 line:0%
you can have whatever

00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:33.040 line:0%
you want.

00:41:33.700 --> 00:41:35.860 line:0%
As for those people you care about,

00:41:36.510 --> 00:41:38.310 line:0%
for your sake,

00:41:39.330 --> 00:41:41.050 line:0%
I won't be too hard on them.